You may be a bit disappointed to hear it, but: dragons aren't actually
that hard to
kill.  You would have no way of knowing this if your only prior
experience is as a level
1 character -- if the wand of polymorph had produced a soldier ant or
a leucrotta, you
probably would have been equally dead.

The thing to be most concerned about is the breath weapon, but
reflection deals
with all breath weapons (all rays of anything, in fact).  You should
be able to defeat
the dragons (one by one) in melee combat with Mjollnir in hand.
Certainly standing at some distance away and throwing either daggers
or Mjollnir at them will work --
you can hurt them and they can't hurt you.


